    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>Worshipers of the exiled archdevil Moloch twisted the method for making gorgons to build their own fiendish guardians, the brazen gorgons. These hollow, bull-shaped automatons have metal bodies that glow with fierce heat. When they charge, the ribs of their frames swing open like cages to trap enemies and roast them inside. Brazen gorgons are often found in unholy places devoted to Moloch, other archdevils, or bloodthirsty gods.</p>",
        "public": ""
      },
