        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} moves up to its Speed without provoking Opportunity Attacks and can move through the spaces of Medium or smaller creatures. Each time the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} enters a creature's space for the first time during this move, that target is subjected to the following effect. <em>Dexterity Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=BzCktuMQR0So2OLS]]. <em>Failure:</em> [[/damage 2d8 + 4 average type=piercing]] damage plus [[/damage 3d8 average type=fire]] damage, and the target is pulled into the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}'s space and has the &amp;Reference[Grappled apply=false] condition (escape DC 14); if the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} already has a creature Grappled, the target has the &amp;Reference[Prone apply=false] condition instead. Until the grapple ends, the target has the &amp;Reference[Restrained apply=false] condition. When the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} moves, the Grappled target moves with it, costing no extra movement.</p>",
